section('1. 驗收結論','<p><strong>已實作範圍 PASS；完整平台驗收 PARTIAL。</strong>本輪重跑IO220項全GREEN及407項既有回歸，檢查契約、架構與修改範圍，未發現新的阻擋缺陷。產品卡維持黃燈：Windows11與未完成原生別名測試不變成PASS。</p><p>這是同一助理在另一輪進行的唯讀驗收，未另委派獨立審查者。本輪沒有修改產品、測試、Port或schema。</p>')
section('2. Module、目的與工程基線','<p>Primary Module：file-commit。為後續文件保存提供單文件提交：鎖定、預期版本檢查、完整發布、失敗回復與可診斷拒絕。不是多文件交易、Undo、M07復原快照或HOST/UI接線。</p>'+table(['項目','結果'],[['Branch',branch],['HEAD',head],['核准方案A SHA256',sha(protocol)],['本輪來源', '792檔雜湊全部一致'],['實作修改範圍','2個既有核准檔案；其餘790盤點檔不變'],['原196測試','完整保留並在本輪GREEN']]))
section('3. 核准六角架構與依賴圖',pre('Driving adapters: tests / future HOST (unchanged)\n            ↓\nInput Ports: FileCommitPort / FileWriteLease\n            ↓\nWindows single-file transaction adapter\n            ↓\nNative FS + OS handle + existing SPEC SHA256\n\nModule dependency: HOST → PORTS ← ADAPTERS → SPEC(hash)\nWORK Domain / UI: no added adapter/FS dependency')+table(['Boundary','核准責任'],[[k,v]for k,v in model['architecture'].items()]))
section('4. Ports、所有權、Mutation與Transaction','<p>公開兩trait／四方法維持原樣：create_directory_exclusive、acquire_write、read_current、replace_checked。receipt/error欄位未變。lease獨占OS handle；private transaction只追蹤exclusive-create取得的artifact。正式文件仍是正式資料，journal非專案SSOT。</p>'+pre('Acquire → Validate → PrepareOld/New → PREPARED\n→ Recheck → Publish → VerifyPublished → COMMITTED → Receipt\nFailure → Restore → VerifyRestored → ROLLED_BACK\nUnconfirmed → RecoveryRequired + retain versions + block destructive write'))
section('5. 契約與不變量',table(['階段','契約'],[[x['phase'],x['result']+'；'+x['preservation']]for x in model['contracts']])+table(['Invariant','要求'],[[x['id'],x['rule']]for x in design['invariants']]))
section('6. 模組BDD與覆蓋',table(['B1～B12類別','已採納映射'],model['coverage_categories'].items())+'<details><summary>完整原始BDD（歷史planning標籤保留，現行核准與執行證據另列）</summary>'+pre(model['bdd']['baseline_text'])+pre(model['bdd']['gap_text'])+'</details>')
section('7. BDD→Contract→TDD追溯',table(['Requirement / BDD','Tests','本輪'],[[x['requirement']+' / '+x['bdd'],', '.join(x['tests']),'PASS current host']for x in model['traceability']])+'<p>追溯以模組行為為單位；每個測試實際結果保存在test-preservation.json與fresh test log，沒有以單一檔案編譯代替模組完成。</p>')
